OL,3,GNEWSAWoman born on day RAF uncle died
OL,4,Aunveils memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was born on the day her RAF
OL,7,Fpilot uncle was killed during World War
OL,8,FTwo has unveiled a memorial to him more
OL,9,Fthan 80 years later.
OL,11,FLinda McLean, 83, from Horsham in West
OL,12,FSussex, travelled to the village of
OL,13,FNeerkant in the Netherlands to honour
OL,14,FFlight Sergeant Arthur Burgess, who
OL,15,Fdied when his bomber was shot down in
OL,16,FJune 1943.
OL,18,FArthur was 23 when he was killed on 22
OL,19,FJune 1943, the same day his twin sister
OL,20,FDorothy gave birth to Linda.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
