OL,3,GNEWSAWoman born on day RAF uncle died
OL,4,Aunveils memorial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLinda joined relatives of the crew, RAF
OL,7,Frepresentatives and members of the
OL,8,Flocal community at a ceremony unveiling
OL,9,Fa permanent memorial to Arthur and the
OL,10,Ffour crewmen who died alongside him.
